子会長だけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それ以外ではゆみちゃんとかゆみことか関ちゃんとか気軽に呼んでくださったら嬉しいなーと( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せる写真を探したけどなかった…。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自撮りをしなさい!わたし!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というかね、載せたい写真はあるんですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ載せないけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せた時言いますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/05a/5762a0b27c96089dfebc47268bc37.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ載せたことあるかな。ないかな。あるかな。ないであってほしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日!SHOWROOMで会いましょう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ一緒に盛り上げてくださったら嬉しいです☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ、今日はここまでです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関有美子🐱"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-keya-28634":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは^_^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついにヒートテックを卒業しましたよ〜!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイミング見計らってたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流石に今日は着られないと思って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その代わり、エアリズムを買いました✌︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンの時とか、Tシャツの下に着ようかな〜って思ってます🕺"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晴天だったので、太陽の下で、バンバン布団叩いてきました!☀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お陰で布団もふかふかです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毛布はもういいかなー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🌳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねるが、たまたま昨日のブログを読んでくれたみたいで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレエ関係のオススメの映画を送ってくれたんです🥰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しかったー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねるもオダナナも、よく本を読んでいて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人とも視野が広いといいますか、心が寛容で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前、気になった絵があって、その絵の説明に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『本を読むことで元々自分にはない考え方、価値観、思考法、知識などがどんどん入ってきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その結果、本を読む人と読まない人ではこれだけ見える世界に差が生じるのです。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という文章があって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きで、メモしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、昔からあまり本を読まなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校の時にあった、朝の読書週間の時間も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然本が進まなくて。。。📚"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本もマンガも、理解するまで同じところを読み返してしまうので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く時間がかかってしまうんですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":